-400 accent-glow mb-6\">Partner Program</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] text-foreground leading-[1.08]\">Earn <!-- -->10<!-- -->% on every referral</h1><div class=\"mt-8 w-16 h-px bg-brand-300/50 dark:bg-border-strong mx-auto\"></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Share <!-- -->Eppix Labs Canada<!-- --> with your audience. They save <!-- -->10<!-- -->% with your code, you earn on every order it brings in — tracked per order, visible in your own dashboard.</p><div class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center h-12 px-8 rounded-button bg-brand-500 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-brand-600 transition-colors dark:bg-foreground dark:text-background dark:hover:bg-foreground/90\" href=\"/affiliate/apply\">Apply to join</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center h-12 px-8 rounded-button glass-subtle border border-white/30 dark:border-border text-foreground text-sm font-medium hover:bg-white/60 dark:hover:bg-surface-elevated transition-colors\" href=\"/certificates-of-analysis\">See the COAs first</a></div><p class=\"mt-5 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-foreground-muted\">Free to join · No exclusivity · No minimum order</p></div></div></section><section class=\"pb-16 text-readable\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"glass rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-foreground mb-2\">10% cash commission</h2><p class=\"text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">On every order placed with your code. Or take 15% as store credit instead — a better rate if you use the products yourself.</p></div><div class=\"glass rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-foreground mb-2\">10% off for your audience</h2><p class=\"text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Your code is a genuine discount, not just a tracking link. People have a reason to use it, which is why they actually do.</p></div><div class=\"glass rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-foreground mb-2\">Your own dashboard</h2><p class=\"text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Every use of your code, order by order — including the ones where another discount won. No guessing whether it worked.</p></div><div class=\"glass rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-foreground mb-2\">Paid on request</h2><p class=\"text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Commission is paid out on request by e-transfer, PayPal or bank transfer — or taken as store credit at the higher rate. Part-payments and corrections are handled properly, not lost in a spreadsheet.</p></div><div class=\"glass rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-foreground mb-2\">Free, and not exclusive</h2><p class=\"text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">No setup fee, no minimum order, no requirement to stop working with anyone else.</p></div><div class=\"glass rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-[15px] font-medium text-foreground mb-2\">Something worth recommending</h2><p class=\"text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Every batch ships with a third-party certificate of analysis linked to the vial in front of you. You can check what you are putting your name to.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pb-16 text-readable\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><h2 class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-foreground-secondary mb-6 text-center\">How it works</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[20px] font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mb-2\">01</p><p class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground mb-1\">Apply</p><p class=\"text-[12px] text-foreground-muted leading-relaxed\">A short form. Tell us who your audience is.</p></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[20px] font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mb-2\">02</p><p class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground mb-1\">Get your code</p><p class=\"text-[12px] text-foreground-muted leading-relaxed\">Approved partners get a unique discount code and a dashboard login.</p></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[20px] font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mb-2\">03</p><p class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground mb-1\">Share it</p><p class=\"text-[12px] text-foreground-muted leading-relaxed\">Your channel, newsletter, community — wherever your audience already is.</p></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[20px] font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mb-2\">04</p><p class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground mb-1\">Get paid</p><p class=\"text-[12px] text-foreground-muted leading-relaxed\">Commission accrues per confirmed order. Request a payout whenever.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pb-16 text-readable\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><h2 class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-foreground-secondary mb-6 text-center\">Questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"glass-subtle rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border px-5 py-4 group\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">Who is this for?<span class=\"text-foreground-muted shrink-0 transition-transform duration-150 group-open:rotate-45\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Researchers, clinicians, coaches, longevity and fitness creators, community moderators, and newsletter writers — anyone with an audience that has a genuine reason to care about peptide quality. Audience size matters far less than whether they trust you.</p></details><details class=\"glass-subtle rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border px-5 py-4 group\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">When does commission count?<span class=\"text-foreground-muted shrink-0 transition-transform duration-150 group-open:rotate-45\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">When the order is actually paid for, not when it is placed. A cancelled, expired or refunded order reverses — which is also why the numbers you see are the numbers you get.</p></details><details class=\"glass-subtle rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border px-5 py-4 group\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">Cash or store credit?<span class=\"text-foreground-muted shrink-0 transition-transform duration-150 group-open:rotate-45\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Your choice, and you can switch. Cash pays 10%; store credit pays 15%. Orders keep whichever rate applied when they were placed, so switching never rewrites what you have already earned.</p></details><details class=\"glass-subtle rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border px-5 py-4 group\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">Is there a minimum order or payout threshold?<span class=\"text-foreground-muted shrink-0 transition-transform duration-150 group-open:rotate-45\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">No minimum order. Payouts are handled manually on request, so there is no threshold to sit under waiting for a monthly run.</p></details><details class=\"glass-subtle rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border px-5 py-4 group\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">Can I promote other brands?<span class=\"text-foreground-muted shrink-0 transition-transform duration-150 group-open:rotate-45\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Yes. No exclusivity is required or expected.</p></details><details class=\"glass-subtle rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border px-5 py-4 group\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-[14px] font-medium text-foreground flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">What am I allowed to claim?<span class=\"text-foreground-muted shrink-0 transition-transform duration-150 group-open:rotate-45\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"></path></svg></span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\">Nothing we would not claim ourselves. These are research compounds — no medical, dosing or treatment claims. Talk about purity, testing and sourcing, which is where the real story is anyway.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"pb-24 sm:pb-32 text-readable\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"glass rounded-card border border-white/30 dark:border-border p-8 sm:p-10 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground mb-3\">Ready to start?</h2><p class=\"text-[14px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed mb-7 max-w-md mx-auto\">Applications are read by a person, usually within a few business days. Tell us who your audience is and why the fit makes sense.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center h-12 px-8 rounded-button bg-brand-500 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-brand-600 transition-colors dark:bg-foreground dark:text-background dark:hover:bg-foreground/90\" href=\"/affiliate/apply\">Apply to join</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class=\"no-overflow-x\"><footer class=\"glass\"><div class=\"border-b border-white/30 dark:border-border\"><ul class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-1.5 px-4 py-4 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-4 text-[12.5px] text-foreground-secondary\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Independent lab report published for every lot</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>99.48% mean HPLC purity, all lots</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Same-day dispatch before 4 pm · Xpresspost 1–2 days</li><li c